 "Problema que impide que algo funcione con normalidad.", "usage": "Verbo: disrupt. 'cause disruption to something'.", "exampleTr": "La tormenta alteró gravemente los vuelos."}}, "doctors": {"zh": "醫生", "pos": "n.", "base": "doctor", "hi": "डॉक्टर", "en": "people who treat sick people", "es": "médicos"}, "emergency": {"zh": "緊急（emergency care：急診）", "pos": "n.", "base": "emergency", "hi": "आपातकाल (emergency care: आपात चिकित्सा)", "en": "a sudden dangerous situation", "es": "urgencia (emergency care: urgencias)"}, "enough": {"zh": "足夠的", "pos": "adj.", "base": "enough", "hi": "पर्याप्त", "en": "as much as needed", "es": "suficiente"}, "even": {"zh": "甚至", "pos": "adv.", "base": "even", "hi": "भी; यहाँ तक कि", "en": "used to show something is surprising", "es": "incluso"}, "executive": {"zh": "執行機構；管理局", "pos": "n.", "base": "executive", "hi": "कार्यकारी संस्था", "en": "an organisation that manages something", "es": "organismo ejecutivo"}, "expected": {"zh": "預期；預計", "pos": "v.", "base": "expect", "hi": "अपेक्षित", "en": "thought likely to happen", "es": "previsto"}, "expenditure": {"zh": "支出；開支", "pos": "n.", "base": "expenditure", "hi": "व्यय; खर्च", "en": "money spent", "es": "gasto"}, "experts": {"zh": "專家", "pos": "n.", "base": "expert", "hi": "विशेषज्ञ", "en": "people with special knowledge", "es": "expertos"}, "expired": {"zh": "（協議）到期；失效", "pos": "v.", "base": "expire", "note": {"meaning": "（合約、證件、協議）到期、失效。", "usage": "不及物動詞，不能說 be expired 表示被動；名詞是 expiry/expiration。", "collocations": ["the contract expires", "expiry date", "my passport expired"], "example": {"en": "My visa expires at the end of the month.", "zh": "我的簽證月底到期。"}}, "hi": "समाप्त हो गया", "en": "ended; no longer valid", "noteHi": {"meaning": "(समझौता, दस्तावेज़) की अवधि ख़त्म होना।", "usage": "अकर्मक क्रिया है; संज्ञा expiry।", "exampleTr": "मेरा वीज़ा महीने के अंत में ख़त्म होता है।"}, "noteEn": {"meaning": "When an agreement or document comes to an end and is no longer valid.", "usage": "Intrans